---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import {site} from '../../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Certificate and Affiliation | NAC-MIT Dhamtari" description="Read confirmed certificate and affiliation information for DCA and PGDCA at NAC-MIT Computer Training Center."><Breadcrumbs current="Certificate and affiliation"/><section class="container py-12 md:py-20"><p class="eyebrow">Certificate & affiliation</p><h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-5xl">Understand what is confirmed for each course.</h1><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-brand-navy p-8 text-white"><p class="eyebrow !text-brand-yellow">DCA + PGDCA</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl">University affiliation</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-brand-muted-light">{site.affiliation}</p></div><div class="border border-brand-line p-8"><p class="eyebrow">Course completion</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl">Certificate information</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-brand-muted">Marksheet and certificate facilities are provided according to eligibility, course rules and applicable affiliation or certification guidelines. Ask NAC-MIT to confirm the exact documentation for your selected course.</p></div></div></section></Layout>